WEBVTT

00:19:27.138 --> 00:19:30.637
There's always somebody
who wants to confiscate our humanity.

00:19:31.011 --> 00:19:33.266
And there are always
stories that restore it.

00:19:33.816 --> 00:19:35.371
If we live out loud,

00:19:35.395 --> 00:19:37.392
we can trounce the hatred,

00:19:37.416 --> 00:19:39.622
and expand everyone's lives.

00:19:40.569 --> 00:19:41.785
Forge meaning.

00:19:42.222 --> 00:19:43.580
Build identity.

00:19:44.169 --> 00:19:45.731
Forge meaning.

00:19:46.393 --> 00:19:48.379
Build identity.

00:19:49.228 --> 00:19:52.135
And then invite the world
to share your joy.

00:19:52.675 --> 00:19:53.874
Thank you.

00:19:53.898 --> 00:19:56.916
(Applause)

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:58.158
Thank you.

00:19:58.182 --> 00:20:00.200
(Applause)